Description: avcodec/cbs_sei: put a new H.264 SEI unit in front of the IDR slice
 A new prefix SEI unit belongs before the first VCL NAL unit. The H.264
 search excluded the IDR slice type, so an access unit containing an IDR
 slice and no SEI received its new SEI after the slice. A decoder then
 associates the message with the next picture.
 .
 The expected output of fate-cbs-h264-metadata-sei changes with it: its
 reference was made with the SEI behind the IDR slice. The new stream has
 it in front of the slice: AUD, SPS, PPS, SEI, IDR.
 .
